| 17p5-0add-18deg-75s-N2-1800s (run1) | 936.59 | 0.27 | Single specimen only; wrinkle |
| 17p5-0add-20deg-90s-N2-1250s (run2) | 960.52 | 0.27 | Very high modulus, low PF; high SD |
| 19-0add-10deg-90s-N2-1800s | 1015.72 | 0.26 | Single specimen; bottom gap/wrinkle |
| 18-0add-15deg-600s-NoN2-1350s (run3) | 385.22 | 0.41 | High PF, low modulus |
| 17p5-0add-15deg-400s-NoN2-1800s | 400.47 | 0.40 | High PF, low modulus |
| 17p5-0add-15deg-200s-NoN2-1800s | 340.70 | 0.38 | High PF, low modulus |
| 19-0add-10deg-240s-NoN2-1600s (run2) | 312.52 | 0.38 | High PF, low modulus |
